[{"title":"登大峰山","author":"卢琦","text":"一径盘桓上碧峰，桃花岩畔扣仙宫。\n微风不动坛边树，北斗频悬石上松。\n龙出洞云浮槛白，鸡鸣海日射窗红。\n游人咫尺青天近，历历溪山在眼中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16220,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过平溪桥","author":"卢琦","text":"立马桥边唤渡船，绿杨烟煖碧波悬。\n高峰碍日疑天近，阴壑犹霜觉地偏。\n处处鱼盐开草市，家家鸡犬类桃源。\n隔溪茅屋孤门掩，重忆扬雄草《太玄》。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16221,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游北里三峰寺","author":"卢琦","text":"看云远过古丛林，幽径缘溪窕窈深。\n竹覆僧房冷似水，苔生佛面半无金。\n日斜孤鹤松梢立，云冷寒蛩草际吟。\n童子焚香延客坐，一帘山色晚沈沈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16222,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行杂咏 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"过一山坳又一村，小溪流水映柴门。\n桑间少妇自采叶，舍下老翁閒弄孙。\n山雾欲收红日晏，蕨根新洗碧潭浑。\n停舆暂向石亭坐，隐隐樵歌隔水闻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16223,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行杂咏 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"荒径横烟日色微，森森翠竹掩茅扉。\n邻翁乞火蒸藜藿，童女临溪洗葛衣。\n袅袅柳丝烟外细，青青梅子雨中肥。\n老农蛮语留人宿，儿出耕田暮欲归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16224,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行杂咏 其三","author":"卢琦","text":"拂拂轻风谷雨初，绿杨堤上步纡徐。\n竹林生笋长过母，巢燕扑虫归哺雏。\n雨散溪流平岸涨，云开岩树倚天孤。\n凭谁唤起王摩诘，写入秋毫作画图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16225,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行杂咏 其四","author":"卢琦","text":"孤村欲暝绝飞鸦，落日高原树树霞。\n野水微风轻皱縠，林峦横雾薄笼纱。\n山边邻火逢人灭，云际星光到地斜。\n自作幕宾今五载，几回乘月到田家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16226,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再游南庄","author":"卢琦","text":"飞凤山南树色苍，疏篱野屋对蒲塘。\n岩云掩日收残暑，溪雨回风生午凉。\n手种晚菘盈囿嫩，饭炊新稻满厨香。\n叩门休认催租吏，愿借竹林飞羽觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16227,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梦中得二句云万里春潮随月上数声渔笛隔溪闻觉而足云","author":"卢琦","text":"竹蓬窗外雨纷纷，清夜诗人思不群。\n万里春潮随月上，数声渔笛隔溪闻。\n梦回身世犹蓬岛，望断家山只白云。\n最喜遭逢圣明世，拟将事业对明君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16228,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"泊小孤山","author":"卢琦","text":"扁舟系缆大江滨，与客登临漫怆神。\n尘世几经兴废事，江流不管古今人。\n秋生彭泽松声老，日落孤山雁影新。\n归到蓬窗眠不得，远怀故国梦频频。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16229,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雩都县西禅田寺有生佛甚灵殿后有竹十三竿云是佛在日所敲之竹即今存焉","author":"卢琦","text":"忽闻生佛到禅关，花木深深作翠团。\n座上真身千百载，窗前敲竹十三竿。\n苔封古砌廊庑尽，秋入山门风雨寒。\n啜罢茶瓯僧话别，孤舟催客泊前滩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16230,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿会昌铺","author":"卢琦","text":"会昌郭外暂维舟，满眼风光慰宦游。\n日落千山红树晚，夜深二水碧溪秋。\n忘忧草色迷官舍，桂子花香沁酒楼。\n回首乡关何处是，白云遮断使人愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16231,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿武林禅果寺","author":"卢琦","text":"囊书匣剑宿禅房，坐听更筹夕未央。\n绀殿香消灯影小，故乡梦觉雨声凉。\n候蛩戒夜秋将晚，征雁拂云天正长。\n默计客程成独喜，武平取次是程乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16232,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题吴元珍钓图","author":"卢琦","text":"老翁撑船傍芦荻，船头独坐看秋波。\n不知昨夜风声恶，但见满溪山色多。\n谁人著笔成图画，有客吟诗学棹歌。\n我亦颇识江海趣，几时同子披烟蓑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16233,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游林肃寺和林清源先生韵","author":"卢琦","text":"秋到人间才六日，閒寻野寺过莲华。\n雷声忽度山中雨，雾气遥凝海上霞。\n古院疏槐堪系马，荒城落日又啼鸦。\n老僧不管兴亡事，独闭松扉自煮茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16234,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再过钟山万寿寺有感","author":"卢琦","text":"紫翠烟霞出上方，游人登览忆先皇。\n石栏空见岩花乱，翠辇不来山路荒。\n此日风云馀王气，旧时草木被天香。\n夜深寂寞人归后，犹有山灵护御床。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16235,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题郑克让渊明卷","author":"卢琦","text":"靖节高名垂宇宙，何须五斗折腰为。\n柴桑岁暮骥将老，栗里云深鹤已归。\n松菊厌沾新雨露，衣巾不改旧容仪。\n于今郑谷人归未，学得陶翁自古稀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16236,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"饯德化王知县","author":"卢琦","text":"悠悠乡思逐云飞，匣剑囊琴赋式微。\n客计不如归计好，宦情长与世情违。\n石田茅屋生苔藓，凫舄朝衫换彩衣。\n留得棠梨花一树，龙寻山下款春晖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16237,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和经略使从事间可理问同年","author":"卢琦","text":"偶行村落采民谣，自愧疏庸负圣朝。\n海水连天风浩浩，山房尽日雨潇潇。\n王师未息烟尘暗，驿使相思道路遥。\n定拟榕阴重话旧，九仙峰顶看秋潮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16238,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再分司海口即事寄桂尚文都事","author":"卢琦","text":"去年曾此徵邦课，不惮驰驱上下亭。\n今日重来头顿白，故人相见眼俱青。\n春郊战马尘初暗，夜月啼鹃梦易醒。\n盐事又兴农事废，穷阎愁叹不堪听。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16239,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题全安庄","author":"卢琦","text":"野寺寻真幽更幽，老僧敬客客来游。\n疏钟几杵江山暮，落雁一声天地秋。\n山鸟有情怜我去，烛花溅泪为谁愁。\n而今惆怅江头别，不识重来有日不。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16240,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过吴江","author":"卢琦","text":"兴随流水共悠悠，此地芦花正满洲。\n落日片帆千里暮，西风长笛数声秋。\n衣冠空带英雄泪，湖海难消浩荡愁。\n吟罢欲寻沽酒处，傍人遥指隔江楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16241,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"饯宪使元卿赴浙江参政","author":"卢琦","text":"姬旦周元老，更生汉懿亲。\n皇朝右文治，岳狩选儒臣。\n夙志由来著，清声久已振。\n万钧风力重，一道月华新。\n肃政高群望，嘉猷播绝伦。\n总闽持绣斧，参浙坐华茵。\n海峤升初日，湖山宴早春。\n登临频赋咏，万物改清贞。\n勋业归调鼎，恩荣促召轮。\n欣逢天纵圣，重见岳生申。\n报主惟深敬，忧民亶至仁。\n魁梧表仪羽，敷治展经纶。\n方面分廷务，东吴振日宸。\n具瞻岩石峻，列坐庙堂珍。\n薇省花容煖，春城柳色颦。\n迎归舟楫具，文著宪章纯。\n接履登高位，乘槎据要津。\n推恩均雨露，举首近星辰。\n贱子初登第，明公领缙绅。\n疏慵期采录，悚惧走逡巡。\n忝对南宫岁，长怀北阙晨。\n三年亲簿领，几处困风尘。\n从事沾微禄，鮿生似旧贫。\n骏奔惟恐后，久屈欲求伸。\n拙守诗为业，怀成道日陈。\n驽才慕骥足，污渎敢攀鳞。\n曩昔期朝士，迟回忝国宾。\n愿言为汲引，自许绝缁磷。\n北斗天河上，南州瘴露滨。\n惟将涓滴念，日夕望秋旻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16242,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠府训林先生之京二十韵","author":"卢琦","text":"尧历开昌运，升平十四春。\n鹤书驰云路，鹗荐贡儒珍。\n宦族西湖裔，家声阀阅亲。\n异才旧卓荦，衍庆自殊伦。\n彼美仙壶客，由来紫帽邻。\n范模资郡泮，俊秀萃成均。\n鳣雀升杨震，桂林羡郤诜。\n雕盘辞苜蓿，琼宴念嘉宾。\n射隼高墉上，乘槎天汉滨。\n器成时获利，道达志常伸。\n际会风云日，沾濡雨露晨。\n秋鹏搏翼健，雾豹泽毛新。\n正欲抠衣侍，那堪别话陈。\n东亭芳草合，南浦绿波邻。\n骊驹闲戒仆，紫燕语留人。\n俯拾金闺彦，行看昼锦臣。\n诸生刺桐下，侧耳好音频。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16243,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠周信玉","author":"卢琦","text":"秦川周子衣冠胄，家世相传几百年。\n青草一庭香满屋，白岩万古势连天。\n读书空谷人如玉，唤渡长江月在船。\n梦寄短檠疏雨外，诗成石涧古梅边。\n忽惊紫气排云入，共喜清宵听雪眠。\n归去故人应问我，为言荒落尚依然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16244,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"饯孙复斋赴南雄同知","author":"卢琦","text":"闻说刺桐城外道，使君七日赴南雄。\n枫宸锡命黄金带，荔浦飘香绕玉骢。\n剑拂洛桥涛泊岸，驿经庾岭树连空。\n山中五月畬田熟，海上诸州水道通。\n幽涧昼飞椰叶雨，寒潮夜渡鳄鱼风。\n绿林处处归民伍，皂盖时时谒学宫。\n定有诸生师柳子，莫将循吏让文翁。\n化行稚耄讴歌起，讼简宾僚笑咏同。\n千里相思明月夕，新题遥寄海云东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16245,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过峡口浦","author":"卢琦","text":"峡仄蜂腰断，溪回燕尾分。\n行人思涧壑，身世若浮云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16246,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"县斋閒坐偶成","author":"卢琦","text":"庭树雪初晴，双双鸣鹊声。\n六花消未尽，犹照叶心明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16247,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"翠峰梅雪","author":"卢琦","text":"苍龙吼翠涛，白雾迷青壁。\n顷刻赤乌飞，风枝堕残滴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16248,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题杜容可筼居卷 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"种得筼筜日转添，东风暗绿上疏帘。\n近来春信知多少，屋角新梢已拂檐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16249,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题杜容可筼居卷 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"道人家住绿云间，日日吟诗独倚栏。\n二仲不来山径晚，一帘清影作秋寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16250,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"兴化道中","author":"卢琦","text":"雨过山城野水浑，夕阳黄犊卧篱根。\n吴塘父老应相语，昨夜南船到海门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16251,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"泊洗溪驿","author":"卢琦","text":"篷底凄风过似箭，枕边急浪响于雷。\n梦魂曾到桐阴下，夜未三更又却回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16252,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"岁寒","author":"卢琦","text":"木落山空劲节存，独留清影向黄昏。\n满床风雪无人到，知是江南何处村。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16253,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和郑子经游仙宗寺韵","author":"卢琦","text":"玉堂老鹤仙骑去，白雪满空何处寻。\n昨夜飞来峰顶月，分明照见古人心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16254,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再用子经韵简曾元瑞 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"千里青山绿树深，雨中骑马惬幽寻。\n故园松柏秋风早，无限新愁上客心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16255,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再用子经韵简曾元瑞 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"蓬莱弱水渺难量，何自堪求却老方。\n佳客不来成独立，一庭松影暮天凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16256,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘友峰再游南泉 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"手携数尺绿玉杖，口诵青囊一卷经。\n莫向北山寻旧隐，夜深猿鹤不堪听。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16257,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘友峰再游南泉 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"立马卧龙山下路，白云东去是吾家。\n烦君为寄西风信，直到疏篱问菊花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16258,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陆德阳杭州新居 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"武林城下文章客，移得幽居近碧湾。\n闻说梅花开欲遍，一舟冲雨到孤山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16259,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陆德阳杭州新居 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"青山隔屋暮云湿，红日当空春水明。\n月满六桥歌舞散，柳阴深处有书声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16260,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"草萍驿和萨天锡","author":"卢琦","text":"林外轻风帽影斜，客衣近染紫山霞。\n等閒点检春多少，墙角蔷薇几树花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16261,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蒜岭道中","author":"卢琦","text":"谁家种稻覆山田，何处钟声隔暮烟。\n渡口潮深风满海，岭头云尽月当天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16262,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿莆阳玄妙观赠一山道人 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"曾向山房夜听琴，白云有约许重寻。\n吟成立尽虚檐月，落叶满庭秋意深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16263,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿莆阳玄妙观赠一山道人 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"白昼炉熏袅碧烟，小窗清梦快游仙。\n人间何处无瑶草，不信蓬壶别有天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16264,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送阮洞仙","author":"卢琦","text":"我住桃源六十年，神仙不见意茫然。\n如今驻马壶山下，始信城中有洞仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16265,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题四皓图","author":"卢琦","text":"鹤发苍颜太古心，采芝共入白云深。\n只因误到长安寺，惹得人间说至今。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16266,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"钱舜举木芙蓉","author":"卢琦","text":"红妆初映酒杯酣，斜倚西风转不堪。\n霜后池塘秋欲尽，令人惆怅忆江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16267,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洗长图","author":"卢琦","text":"千里名驹出渥洼，十年汗血染尘沙。\n如今海上都无事，杨柳池边浴五花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16268,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玄妙观作","author":"卢琦","text":"树间宿霭喜初收，树梢晴岚翠欲流。\n半醉半醒诗未就，一夜西风叶叶秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16269,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题射猎图","author":"卢琦","text":"满目西风塞上尘，五花骢马转精神。\n凭君莫射双飞雁，恐有音书寄远人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16270,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题山水图","author":"卢琦","text":"渔舟风雨蓑衣冷，僧寺烟霏㙮影斜。\n行客莫嫌天色暝，隔江鸡犬有人家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16271,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舟泊扬州","author":"卢琦","text":"晓发瓜州古渡头，好风半日到扬州。\n客船只向城西泊，何处吹箫月满楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16272,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寒山寺","author":"卢琦","text":"古寺萧条枕碧漪，几人泚笔好题诗。\n客船也有钟声到，不是姑苏夜半时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16273,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题山水卷","author":"卢琦","text":"野径穿云入翠微，山家茅屋掩柴扉。\n扁舟独钓沧江上，风雨满船犹未归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16274,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题捕鱼图 其一","author":"卢琦","text":"水光不动棹声迟，阿母舟中坐哺儿。\n却笑世途风浪恶，人家骨肉苦分离。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16275,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题捕鱼图 其二","author":"卢琦","text":"白衣渔父独操舟，两岸西风芦荻秋。\n稚子莫惊滩水险，险滩过了是安流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16276,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蒲萄","author":"卢琦","text":"夏半蒲萄正熟时，累累满架紫金垂。\n甘酸亦自能消渴，可惜相如早不知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16277,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画梅","author":"卢琦","text":"枝头春雪瑩芳樽，绰约冰姿袭醉魂。\n翠羽影残清梦觉，满天霜月正黄昏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16278,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"堂堂","author":"张翥","text":"朝为堂堂吟，暮为堂堂讴。\n堂堂徒尔奇，堂堂徒尔忧。\n不见膏与兰，煎燔祗自休。\n勿以不遇故，弃捐经与史。\n勿以势利故，弃捐廉与耻。\n勿以行役故，弃捐山与水。\n谓夜未遽央，已复明星明。\n仰视何煌煌，白露忽沾裳。\n怀人搅余心，何以勿永伤。\n江北亦为客，江南亦为客。\n为客多偪兀，何以安所适。\n上有君与亲，下有妻与息。\n在山则种榆，在隰则种蒲。\n马牛必维娄，舟航必繻袽。\n富贵富贵友，贫贱贫贱徒。\n岁月来者多，江湖逝者远。\n所得不可逝，所期不可返。\n幸此世累轻，归去衡门偃。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16279,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗七首 其一","author":"张翥","text":"先人有夙训，闻在幼壮时。\n岂意衰暮日，乃复新验之。\n茫茫上天理，讵可私臆知。\n百年大化中，流浪从推移。\n信彼杞忧者，徒为众所嗤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16280,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗七首 其二","author":"张翥","text":"叔子邻家儿，探环记前身。\n次律求师后，一悟了宿因。\n我亦清源洞，蜕骨岩下人。\n误堕声利区，驱驰丧其真。\n所以付樽酒，都忘贱与贫。\n惜无还丹术，高举遗世尘。\n悠悠笙鹤期，旷望三山津。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16281,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗七首 其三","author":"张翥","text":"寒日迫县车，寸阴老愈惜。\n晨趋理公务，暮返亲坟籍。\n究往发孤愤，思来抱深惕。\n理惬复相忘，神劬聊一息。\n湛然拥襟坐，栩栩鼻端白。\n千龄与化终，不朽在方策。\n圣哲有明训，学道庶自益。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16282,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗七首 其四","author":"张翥","text":"寒夜何皛皛，中庭积繁霜。\n天风下河汉，万里流玉光。\n羽衣四三人，各乘白凤凰。\n笙响发空际，游云高驰翔。\n无缘执霞佩，揽结双明珰。\n愿托月中桂，终古有馀芳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16283,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗七首 其五","author":"张翥","text":"陇坂何崎岖，行人且复止。\n直上望晴川，遥遥忆乡里。\n流离肝肠断，悲歌不能已。\n一身已遐征，永念同室子。\n何殊转蓬科，随风四散起。\n虽得同根生，不得同根死。\n吾洒古今泪，多于陇头水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":16284,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]